The MCP server exists: dist/index.js, stdio MCP server for Chrome DevTools Protocol ("chrome-ws"). It likely launches/connects to a local Chrome. Add to project .mcp.json:

{
  "mcpServers": {
    "prax": {...existing...},
    "chrome": {
